  "provider": "openrouter",
  "requestedModel": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free",
  "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-05T00:40:58.842828Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-05T00:48:57.934473Z",
  "totalBlocks": 72,
  "translatedBlocks": 57,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "04f1caae48efbb23",
      "translationZh": "是的，这篇文章经过 AI 润色，从笔记和基准测试整理成了文章。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "53495e1a9d5a4a72",
      "translationZh": "其背后的工作是我们编译器（Paiton）经过三年多开发的结果",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "aa8702096adda9ce",
      "translationZh": "是的，我们的 RDNA 工作可自由使用",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a42c5f65f16bda56",
      "translationZh": "以建设性的方式做出贡献，不要当喷子。即使你有“妈宝”问题，也没必要表现得像个孩子。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "681016689f60ad2b",
      "translationZh": "TL;DR：Qwen3.8 27B 在单张 AMD Radeon AI PRO R9700（32 GB，300 W）上运行，结合推测解码和我们 3 位权重（并非全面 3 位量化，详见下文），其新的编码模式现在可保留 569,878 个可复用缓存 token。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "77054a5ec549de57",
      "translationZh": "每个请求都拥有 262,144 个 token 的上下文，并且可以同时容纳两个完整长度的请求。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "46eda1ba31a6ca46",
      "translationZh": "编程智能体在每一轮都会重新发送整个对话；现在只需读取新增的部分。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "110f989e9241c82a",
      "translationZh": "后续的智能体轮次启动速度提升高达 12 倍，整个智能体会话完成速度快约 6 倍，且服务器已经读取过的 258K token 文档返回时间从 134 秒缩短至 2.7 秒。解码速度和准确率与我们之前的版本相比处于误差范围内。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e6e5732a5e2ee314",
      "translationZh": "更倾向于 4-bit？只需一个命令即可使用 MXFP4。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3d4c8965861c1726",
      "translationZh": "“3-bit？算了。” 有道理。以下是它的真实情况",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6dfc6a4d00196fc9",
      "translationZh": "这并不是一种一刀切的 3-bit 量化：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "dc305bcd370d2073",
      "translationZh": "只有大型投影矩阵是 3-bit 的：包括 MLP、注意力机制以及循环（Gated DeltaNet）投影，占 27B 参数中的 24.3B。每 128 个权重组成的一个块都有其独立的缩放因子，总计每个权重约为 3.1 bit。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5f50fcefecf44368",
      "translationZh": "其他所有内容都不是 3-bit：嵌入层、输出头、归一化层以及其他循环层参数均来自我们的 MXFP4 版本。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "03ef9c326e16c44c",
      "translationZh": "矩阵在量化之前进行旋转：旋转可以分散那些通常会破坏低比特权重的离群值。随后，它们会在约 293K 个具有许可数据的 token 上进行 GPTQ 校准。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d16ffd87942930ba",
      "translationZh": "Token 生成使用 8-bit (FP8) 激活值。读取提示词时，在旋转后的矩阵上使用 4-bit 激活值（即 W3A4 中的 \"A4\"）。下方的准确率数据同时包含了这两者。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "baab9bf57248d4a6",
      "translationZh": "所有内容均已发布：权重、校准源和每个分片的哈希值都可以在 Hugging Face 上找到。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "576bbb791fe93631",
      "translationZh": "在相同显卡、默认 65K 模式下，你所权衡的指标如下：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a1e78fecf6832ef6",
      "translationZh": "200,000 (已测试 220,000)，一次一个",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "35b0d08427cdb5d6",
      "translationZh": "262,144，同时两个 (524,288 可选)",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f03e2c97c60d9b40",
      "translationZh": "200,000 tokens，一个请求",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "38eebf2ff5ebaaa9",
      "translationZh": "4位模式下的可重用（前缀缓存）Token",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c23b88b8c27e5e26",
      "translationZh": "一次性处理全长请求",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "59aabe71644732e1",
      "translationZh": "首个Token生成时间，短提示词 (p50)",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ccf90b5b063ebfb0",
      "translationZh": "95.45 / 92.68 / 59.93 (在误差范围内)",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "95fa238ec151dd83",
      "translationZh": "我们之前发布的 FP8 模式长文本已经具备前缀缓存，可容纳 281,665 个 Token。新的 4 位编码模式缓存量大约是其两倍。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3e8fe72c1be9f8e3",
      "translationZh": "按照 README 中的说明设置 PAITON_* 模型路径（如果已设置好，只需执行 `git pull`）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fe85a33f4d4d3d70",
      "translationZh": "将您的智能体指向 http://127.0.0.1:18982/v1 。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d5f2a8ab8f9ac1c7",
      "translationZh": "模型名称为 Qwen3.8，任何 API 密钥均可使用，上下文窗口为 262,144 个 token。已经在运行我们的 3-bit 权重了吗？无需重新下载。启动器会固定新容器，Docker 会在首次启动时进行拉取。每种模式都包含在 README 中。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8eeb168bd9440a7b",
      "translationZh": "这是带有插件的标准 vLLM：相同的 OpenAI 兼容服务器、相同的 API，以及您已经在使用的相同工具和工作流。无需重新学习，无需迁移。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f7b9bb8ce9a207c2",
      "translationZh": "我们将继续发布遵循上游 vLLM 的全新构建容器。每个容器在发布前都会经过相同的完整验证（速度、准确性、长上下文）。您无需自行构建即可获得上游改进。只需一条命令即可开始提供服务。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2fd0691787ef94cc",
      "translationZh": "它能为编程智能体带来什么",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "909a098e3a3c46b3",
      "translationZh": "如果没有前缀缓存，服务器在每一轮都会重新读取整个提示词：在 250K token 时，在生成第一个 token 之前大约需要两分钟。现在，已完成的请求会一直保持缓存状态，直到空间被需要；第二轮仅读取发生变化的部分；在我们的测试会话中，91–92% 的提示词 token 来自缓存。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0b51a4536a627d89",
      "translationZh": "工作负载（3-bit，关闭思考模式）之前的 4-bit 模式（无前缀缓存） --mode long-kv4 更快",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bc8f72b97e191f3c",
      "translationZh": "20轮对话，从5万个token增长到25.3万个token，整个会话",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c755f9bcad562c91",
      "translationZh": "… 第2至20轮的首个token平均等待时间",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3bb42297fe25a300",
      "translationZh": "3个智能体共享一个10万token的仓库，每人5轮，整个会话",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ac8dbf725d7c3ef0",
      "translationZh": "… 后续轮次的首个token平均等待时间",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "46208083cefe5fa5",
      "translationZh": "关于已读取的25.8万token文档的新问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b4be2ee598dbeb02",
      "translationZh": "针对25.8万token文档的缓存回答与冷启动读取完全一致。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3e81f87a9147f621",
      "translationZh": "速度详情（BetterBench，完整20轮运行）：单流解码在0.5%以内；8个请求时增加3.5%（4个请求时减少2.5%）；首个token等待时间保持不变。新的长提示词读取速度慢约3%，短提示词慢7-13%（仅几分之一秒）。这是在每个预填充步骤结束时，以便后续请求可以从缓存中接续所付出的代价。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6192b1d2676f602d",
      "translationZh": "准确率（贪婪搜索，每题成对比较）：编程模式的准确率在之前版本的误差范围内，且512K模式的准确率在编程模式的误差范围内。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e9ac56344fbbece0",
      "translationZh": "MXFP4 上一个版本 (3-bit) --mode long-kv4 --mode long-512k",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a5ae84a5d6ac3d9d",
      "translationZh": "选择性加入：单次请求 524,288 个 token",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c269f3fb5722f5a8",
      "translationZh": "--mode long-512k 通过模型的官方长上下文缩放来扩展位置范围。该缩放适用于此模式下的每个请求，因此仅在单个请求需要超过 262K 时才使用它。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "900ad6904a76775e",
      "translationZh": "它在 300K token 时找到了 4/4 个植入事实，在 500K token 时也找到了 4/4 个。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "199c2931b8260817",
      "translationZh": "冷启动读取在 300K 时耗时 158 秒，在 500K 时耗时约 6 分钟。后续问题从缓存中读取耗时 2.8–4.4 秒。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ea42e37ea1934057",
      "translationZh": "缓存容量为 594,290 个 token，加权解码误差在 0.6% 以内（在一次运行中，聊天类别的速度慢了 16%）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9a2f01bf1a47359b",
      "translationZh": "MXFP4 (run-mxfp4.sh) 仍然存在，并且仍然是最准确的选项。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "382151efdc8c4179",
      "translationZh": "--vision 在默认的 65K 模式和 --mode long 模式下均可工作（图像上下文高达 245K token）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "969c2808cc0fca16",
      "translationZh": "前一个版本只需添加一个 --image 标志即可使用（参见 README）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7ae67dfd61ca8fe1",
      "translationZh": "系统内存：coding 模式和 512K 模式会为嵌入表占用 2.4 GiB 的系统内存，16 GB 内存已足够（已测试）。当总内存低于约 13.5 GiB 时，--mode long-kv4 会将表保留在 GPU 上并缓存 451,879 个 token。你仍然可以获得每次请求 262K 的容量以及前缀缓存。--mode long-512k 则需要使用 RAM。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3baf294691b4c856",
      "translationZh": "冷读取：首次读取 258K token 的提示词仍需超过两分钟。只要提示词的开头保持不变（相同的系统提示词，顶部没有时间戳），从第二次请求开始缓存就会发挥作用。usage.prompt_tokens_details.cached_tokens 会显示每一次命中情况。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "486cf7adcd80d174",
      "translationZh": "视觉功能尚未包含在 coding 或 512K 模式中。对于具有长上下文的图像，请使用 --mode long --vision。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "99ec962187b7ec91",
      "translationZh": "RAM/SSD 缓存层：用于前缀缓存的实验性系统内存层（--host-cache-gib，以及其后的 SSD 层）可以将更多上下文从显卡中溢出。目前它适用于 FP8 --mode long；对 4-bit coding 模式的支持将在下一个版本中推出。coding 模式的 569,878 token GPU 缓存目前已可以使用。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
